        :rulingText """You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn't a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2022-10-14"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype "Powerstone" and the ability "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can't be spent to cast a nonartifact spell.\""""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2022-10-14"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Although all the cards in The Brothers' War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn't part of the token's definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won't enter the battlefield tapped."""@en ] .

